{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bouncing logo screensaver, auto battler, roguelike, extravaganza.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPIKED SIDES DO DAMAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round do battle with enemy logos. Deal damage and take damage depending on which sides are spikey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUY A BUFF?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend a few coins in the shop to upgrade your logo. Gain attack sides, heal up, maybe even recruit an ally. But beware, some shops are...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PICK YOUR POISON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some shops are poisoned. You MUST pick at least one. Poisons will usually heal you and give you money but will upgrade your enemy. They may gain attack sides, be healed or even increase in number.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROUND AND ROUND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more rounds you complete, the harder the game will become. Will you be able to balance your buffs and pick your poisons?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006430?t=1762526376","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006430?t=1762526376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006430/1b8c59e5ad99bb62241d58d5c43a82edb6b4ebdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762526376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006430/1b8c59e5ad99bb62241d58d5c43a82edb6b4ebdb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762526376","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bouncing logo screensaver, auto battler, roguelike, extravaganza.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPIKED SIDES DO DAMAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round do battle with enemy logos. Deal damage and take damage depending on which sides are spikey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUY A BUFF?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend a few coins in the shop to upgrade your logo. Gain attack sides, heal up, maybe even recruit an ally. But beware, some shops are...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PICK YOUR POISON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some shops are poisoned. You MUST pick at least one. Poisons will usually heal you and give you money but will upgrade your enemy. They may gain attack sides, be healed or even increase in number.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROUND AND ROUND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more rounds you complete, the harder the game will become. Will you be able to balance your buffs and pick your poisons?</p>","developers":["RAJACORP"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006430/23c13b2bd4aa982b43986d781a1a98735c5382b4/header.jpg?t=1762526376","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-7300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.14 Mojave or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 1000NG4 or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 617<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4006430/1370231438/80e8ba531ad4e4c2a7f3a868a0637f5560420e04/1760725746/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760735483","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4006430/1370231438/80e8ba531ad4e4c2a7f3a868a